# Three players vote, starting with the caster (CR 701.38a): Bot1 and Bot2 vote for Bot3's Sol Ring, Bot3 votes for its own Mox
# Sapphire. The Sol Ring has two votes and the Mox one, so only the Sol Ring is exiled - a permanent is exiled only if it has the most
# votes or is tied for most.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Plains
Council's Judgment
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x14

[Bot3 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Plains x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
Bot3.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot3.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot3.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
