Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Council's Judgment.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Sol Ring)
Bot2.Choose(Sol Ring)
Bot3.Choose(Mox Sapphire)
